      ),
    );
  }
}
```
In this example, the `MyConcreteViewModel` instance is created instead of the `MyViewModel` instance, which provides specific implementation details for the `setName` and `setIsChecked` methods. The `ChangeNotifierProvider` widget is used to provide access to the `MyViewModel` instance to its child Widgets, as before.
